<score-partwise version="4.0">
  <work>
    <work-title>奇异恩典：小提琴与钢琴完整编曲 / Amazing Grace</work-title>
  </work>
  <identification>
    <creator type="composer">Traditional · arr. Music Viewer</creator>
    <rights>Traditional; Breizh Partitions, Mutopia-2012/02/12-1832. Music Viewer complete independent violin/piano arrangement: introduction, complete hymn theme, motivic dialogue, complete piano theme with violin counterpoint, and coda. Bagpipe-specific grace figures are omitted in this instrumental adaptation; all hymn phrases are retained. Music Viewer 完整小提琴与钢琴编曲：前奏、完整传统旋律、原创器乐对答、钢琴再现与尾声；不是主题的整曲循环。</rights>
  </identification>
